~ start
Guide: Hello, {{player_name}}.
set gold += 5
if gold >= 10:
	Guide: You have {{gold}} gold. You look rich.
else:
	Guide: You have {{gold}} gold. You look poor.
Guide: Pick a door.
- Left door => left
- Right door [if has_key /] => right
- Leave => END

~ left
Guide: You went left.
=> END

~ right
set doors_opened += 1
Guide: The key opens the right door.
=> END
